Python removed distutils in 3.12, but Node 18 still imports
distutils.version.StrictVersion from configure.py and its bundled GYP.
Python 3.14 also removed the deprecated FancyURLopener API.  Reuse the
packaging module already vendored by npm's node-gyp, backport the current
urllib implementation, and accept the Python 3.14 host interpreter provided
by the build system.

